  "metadata": {
    "title": "Workflow 1 - Master Reference Image Generator",
    "description": "Generates 3 master reference images per character for LoRA training. Uses Z-Image-Turbo with SeedVR2 inference, face detailing, and film grain. Optimized for RTX 5090 (32GB VRAM).",
