      "pos": [50, 50],
      "size": [400, 200],
      "properties": {
        "text": "WORKFLOW 1: MASTER IMAGE GENERATOR\n=====================================\nGenerates 3 reference images per character:\n  - Face 01: Front-facing portrait (identity anchor)\n  - Face 02: Three-quarter angle (dimensionality)\n  - Face 03: Natural/environmental (personality)\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Set character number in 'Character Selector' (1-21)\n2. Paste prompts from output/master_prompts/\n3. Queue prompt - generates 3 images\n4. Images save to output/master_images/\n\nOPTIMIZED FOR: RTX 5090 32GB VRAM\nMODEL: Z-Image-Turbo with SeedVR2"
      }
    },
